# Prismarine Viewer Edition

## Start prompt

Update RCC so the Minecraft bot supports a selectable protocol version. Keep the
existing current `26.1` version and add/select `1.21.4`, making `1.21.4` the
default and primary bot version for Prismarine compatibility. Apply this
change only to bot connection, protocol negotiation, version validation, and
server-profile configuration.

Work only inside the `afk-console` folder. When the requested implementation
and tests are complete, commit the changes from this folder to the RCC Git
repository with a clear commit message.

Do not modify, rebuild, or debug the Prismarine Viewer, POV renderer, textures,
freecam, browser viewer, or any other POV-related code in this task. Preserve
all existing account authentication, token encryption, reconnect behavior, and
server settings. Add or update tests for version selection and verify that the
project still builds.
